          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.067,
            0.234,
            0.93,
            0.439
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.067,
                0.234,
                0.93,
                0.439
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_0_table_6.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td>环节</td><td>学生记录</td><td>教师追问</td></tr><tr><td>观察</td><td>写出前四排座位数: 18, 21, 24, 27。</td><td>每相邻两项的差是否相等?</td></tr><tr><td>猜想</td><td><eq>a_n = 18 + 3(n-1)</eq></td><td>为什么减去1? 这里的项数有哪些限制?</td></tr><tr><td>验证</td><td><eq>a_1 = 18, \\quad a_4 = 27, \\quad a_{12} = 51</eq></td><td>把首项和末项代回原描述。</td></tr><tr><td>求和</td><td><eq>S_{12} = \\frac{12(18+51)}{2} = 414</eq></td><td>首尾配对时每对的和为什么相同?</td></tr><tr><td>推广</td><td><eq>a_n = a_1 + (n-1)d, \\quad n \\in \\mathbb{N}^*</eq></td><td>给出首项与公差,能否确定整个数列?</td></tr></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.065,
            0.454,
            0.146,
            0.47
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "推导说明"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.065,
            0.48,
            0.456,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "把同一个和倒过来写，两行相加后共有相同的配对和:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.069,
            0.505,
            0.271,
            0.521
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_0_equation_9.jpg",
          "content": "S _ {n} = a _ {1} + a _ {2} + \\dots + a _ {n}"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.069,
            0.531,
            0.288,
            0.547
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_0_equation_10.jpg",
          "content": "S _ {n} = a _ {n} + a _ {n - 1} + \\dots + a _ {1}"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.068,
            0.553,
            0.37,
            0.574
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_0_equation_11.jpg",
          "content": "2 S _ {n} = n (a _ {1} + a _ {n}), \\qquad S _ {n} = \\frac {n (a _ {1} + a _ {n})}{2}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.066,
            0.582,
            0.65,
            0.597
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "上述公式中的除以2来自两份相同的总和；不能把项数只当作一个可省略的标签。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.065,
            0.613,
            0.163,
            0.628
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "辨析与练习"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
